DESCRIPTION:<u></u><a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/51422403">Airpo
 rt</a> 26 miles<br><br><span>This group emphasizes earlier\, moderate-pace
 d rides with routes planned in advance and posted on the ride calendar. Th
 is is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride.  Expect an overall aver
 age moving speed of 12 - 15 mph.  Distances vary from 20 to a little over
  30 miles.  Early season rides will be at the lower end of the distance s
 cale.  During colder weather the ride departs at 1:00pm.  </span><br><b
 r>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getmeregistere
 d.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" target="_blank">free trial memb
 ership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronicall
 y signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.<br><br><br><u></u>
