SUMMARY:I Ride
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260421T174500
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260421T194500
DTSTAMP:20260421T020759Z
UID:s78t1ji96amlnadu8ha9dpfkcg@google.com__20260421
SEQUENCE:1
CREATED:20260316T194515Z
DESCRIPTION:The iRide is a no drop ride with regroup points geared toward 
 the rider wanting to push the pace a bit without being race oriented. 16-1
 8mph avg on most rides. We typically follow the OWLS group route and add s
 ome extra miles/climbs in the second half of the route allowing folks to s
 tart out with us and if we are too fast they can drop back to the OWLS gro
 up. All interested in a brisker pace are welcome!\n\nNon-members should si
 gn up for a free trial membership of up to one month and sign a liability 
 waiver before participating in a club ride. https://secure.getmeregistered
 .com/get_information.php?event_id=141883
LAST-MODIFIED:20260414T101851Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\,
  IN 47401\, USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_cuc66guoam1hhcqq2rnaniinl8_40group_calend
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
SUMMARY:OWLS - 25 Harmony Bridge
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260421T174500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260421T204500
DTSTAMP:20260421T020759Z
UID:3huef73a3q2gvjkknqsmn1n5rq@google.com__20260421
SEQUENCE:1
CREATED:20260302T170708Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/42602670">25 OWLS Harm
 ony Bridge 2023</a><br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="http
 s://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" target
 ="_blank"><u><u><u>free trial membership</u></u></u></a>\, good for up to 
 one month\, and which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\,
  prior to participation.<br><br>The “Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slowe
 r” group emphasizes moderate rides and a route planned in advance that i
 s posted on the ride calendar. This is a no drop ride for a range of inter
 mediate riders—it is not a beginner’s ride. Average pace is 12-15 mph 
 which includes hills.  Regroup points are discussed in advance. Early sea
 son rides are shorter\, and rides get longer as the season progresses. Pea
 k season rides average 25–35 miles\, depending on available daylight. Ri
 des depart promptly at 5:45. Front and rear lights are encouraged. <br><b
 r>Questions? Contact <a href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com" target="_blan
 k"><u><u>Gail Morell</u></u></a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260418T161341Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\,
  IN 47401\, USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
