SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260421T020144Z
DESCRIPTION:<u></u><u></u><p><u><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http
 s://www.strava.com/routes/3342947080255278634&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calend
 ar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3DkAAmdkKx2pK8G04wNgS9" target="_blank">30 45
  Shuffle Southshore 45</a></u><br></p><p>BV Ride is an intermediate/ advan
 ced ride and moderate distance that may or may not include regrouping poin
 ts.  Pace is anticipated to be 18+ mph. Expect occasional sprint or Strav
 a segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, and fewer regrou
 ping stops.</p><p>The BV Ride will start at the Parking lot across from th
 e Bryan Park Pool on Woodlawn at 5:45. Mileages will increase as the seaso
 n progresses. If you keep coming we will make you faster!</p><p>Riders are
  expected to look out for each other during the rides.  Ride maps and GPS
  links will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar with the route sh
 ould bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should sign up for a <
 a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://secure.getmeregistered.com/ge
 t_information.php?event_id%3D133776&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;us
 d=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3NeoFlWD_1flG-21SFUgXK" target="_blank">free trial memb
 ership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes electronicall
 y signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.<u></u><u></u>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260421T020144Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool\, 1020 S Woodlawn Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\, 
 USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
