 andlelit settings\, this band of 14 classical musicians unleash effortles
 sly enchanting melodies alongside powerful walls of distortion. Witness t
 he unexpected union of classical music and metal.</p><p>  Performing the 
 music of iconic bands including: Metallica\, AC/DC\, Rolling Stones\, Rag
 e Against The Machine\, My Chemical Romance\, Linkin' Park\, SOAD\, Guns 
 N Roses\, Evanescence\, Papa Roach\, The Cranberries and more!</p>
