DESCRIPTION:Hosted by: Indiana Memorial Union Board\n\nJoin the Union Boar
 d Spirit and Traditions for Little Little 499! Little Little 499 is Union 
 Board&rsquo\;s take on celebrating one of IU&rsquo\;s most loved tradition
 s\, Little 500. Participate in a cool and fun tricycle race\, open for all
  students to participate in. No prior training is required and everyone is
  welcome to join.&nbsp\; You are required to sign up\, if you are wanting 
 to race\, in teams of 4 and enjoy IU Day with us by competing on a little 
 race track with your friends or your club members. Get the opportunity to 
 win prizes and swag. There will be food trucks\, a rock wall\, and an infl
 atable obstacle course. RSVP NOW! All Indiana University events\, groups\,
  activities\, and educational\, cultural\, and historical observances welc
 ome all IU students and other members of the Indiana University community.
