DESCRIPTION:Hosted by: IU Student Health Center\n\nThink you&rsquo\;re hyd
 rated? Think again . Most of us wait until we&rsquo\;re thirsty to grab a 
 drink\, but by then\, your body is already playing catch-up. Join us for a
 n interactive session where we dive deep into the science of fluids and th
 e physical reality of staying fueled. Learn about the signs and impacts of
