CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:How do we instill a sense of responsibility to our environment
 ? This program dives into guiding philosophies of stewardship\, moral obli
 gation\, and ecological knowledge. [78 min. total runtime]\nThere will be 
 a post-film Q&A with Earth Connection Film Festival directors Dr. Jessica 
 Eise (Indiana University) and Prof. Sarah Lasley (California State Polytec
 hnic University\, Humboldt). Following the screening\, there will be a pla
 nt propagation party in the lower lobby from 3-3:45pm.
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. 7th Street\, Bloomington (on the North end of
  the IU Auditorium)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/earth-connection-film-festival-responsibility/
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//
 EN'>\n<HTML>\n<HEAD>\n<TITLE></TITLE>\n</HEAD>\n<BODY><p>How do we instill
  a sense of responsibility to our environment? This program dives into gui
 ding philosophies of stewardship\, moral obligation\, and ecological knowl
 edge. [78 min. total runtime]</p>\n<p>There will be a post-film Q&A with E
 arth Connection Film Festival directors Dr. Jessica Eise (Indiana Universi
 ty) and Prof. Sarah Lasley (California State Polytechnic University\, Humb
 oldt). Following the screening\, there will be a plant propagation party i
 n the lower lobby from 3-3:45pm.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
