 t/168/crop/1/src_region/0\,0\,1024\,1536/28558_Indiana_University_Foreign_
 Policy_Event.rev.1759952589.png
X-LIVEWHALE-IMAGE-CAPTION:Frontlines &amp\; Futures: Graduate Foreign Poli
 cy Salon Series
X-LIVEWHALE-RSVP:1
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  Engage in guided dialogue on emerging global ch
 allenges\, U.S. strategy\, and multilateral governance while sharpening po
 licy reasoning skills.\n</p>
