DESCRIPTION:Embracing the earth as our home\, these films compassionately 
 and painstakingly capture the depth and nuance of human interdependence wi
 th our planet\, from the lessons we learn to the dirt under our feet. Q&A 
 with one of the filmmakers to follow.\nAbout Earth Connection Film Festiva
 l: Interdependence\nHow do we view our interdependent relationship to Eart
 h? This program zooms in on our reliance on Earth and its resources for ou
 r lives and well-being. [76 min. total runtime]\nThere will be a Q&A with 
 The Old Bear filmmaker Julie Busse following this screening.
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. 7th Street\, Bloomington (on the North end of
  the IU Auditorium)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/earth-connection-film-festival-interdependence/
