 rth as our home\, these films compassionately and painstakingly capture th
 e depth and nuance of human interdependence with our planet\, from the les
 sons we learn to the dirt under our feet. Q&A with one of the filmmakers t
 o follow.<br />\nAbout Earth Connection Film Festival: Interdependence</p>
 \n<p>How do we view our interdependent relationship to Earth? This program
  zooms in on our reliance on Earth and its resources for our lives and wel
 l-being. [76 min. total runtime]</p>\n<p>There will be a Q&A with The Old 
 Bear filmmaker Julie Busse following this screening.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
