 ,1172\,1234/27550_Taraghi_photo.rev.1755119359.jpg" title="Taraghi photo" 
 srcset="https://events.iu.edu/live/image/scale/2x/gid/105/width/300/height
 /283/crop/1/src_region/52\,177\,1172\,1234/27550_Taraghi_photo.rev.1755119
