DESCRIPTION:Hosted by: Turning Point USA at Indiana University\n\nTurning 
 Point USA at Indiana University Bloomington will proudly host Indiana Lieu
 tenant Governor Micah Beckwith for an engaging and thought-provoking event
  on campus. Lt. Gov. Beckwith will speak to students about leadership\, pu
 blic service\, and the importance of civic engagement\, offering insight i
 nto current state issues and the role young people play in shaping the fut
 ure of Indiana. The event will provide attendees with the opportunity to h
 ear directly from a state leader\, ask questions\, and participate in mean
 ingful discussion. TPUSA at IUB continues to bring influential speakers to
  campus to encourage open dialogue\, promote informed perspectives\, and e
 mpower students to get involved in their communities.
