 ) at the local pub\, he finds himself entering a submissive role—both do
 mestic and erotic—for the inscrutable beauty who brings him both satisfa
 ction and confusion\, pain and pleasure. As their affair continues\, Colin
  must decide what he wants and needs—and who he really is. Comic without
