SUMMARY:BV ride -  30 SR 45 Old Myers Sample Dittemore Bottom
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260423T174500
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260423T194500
DTSTAMP:20260421T020835Z
UID:2fp1vu8ac12n92fk1ih9bpi1li@google.com__20260423
SEQUENCE:1
CREATED:20260421T020212Z
DESCRIPTION:<u></u><u></u><p><u><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http
 s://www.strava.com/routes/3136684308024934786&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calend
 ar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw2OZnpW4egHf0_X-56-O_gx" target="_blank">30 SR
  45 Old Myers Sample Dittemore Bottom</a></u><br></p><p>BV Ride is an inte
 rmediate/ advanced ride and moderate distance that may or may not include 
 regrouping points.  Pace is anticipated to be 18+ mph. Expect occasional 
 sprint or Strava segments\, pace line riding at high speed\, intervals\, a
 nd fewer regrouping stops.</p><p>The BV Ride will start at the Parking lot
  across from the Bryan Park Pool on Woodlawn at 5:45. Mileages will increa
 se as the season progresses. If you keep coming we will make you faster!</
 p><p>Riders are expected to look out for each other during the rides.  Ri
 de maps and GPS links will be posted here in advance. Riders unfamiliar wi
 th the route should bring along a copy of the map.</p>Non-members should s
 ign up for a <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://secure.getmere
 gistered.com/get_information.php?event_id%3D133776&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=c
 alendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3NeoFlWD_1flG-21SFUgXK" target="_blank">
 free trial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which include
 s electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.<u><
 /u><u></u>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260421T020256Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park Pool\, 1020 S Woodlawn Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47401\, 
 USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
