 mal experts\, discover what it takes to care for creatures from around the
  globe\, and meet snakes\, lizards\, insects\, arachnids\, and more—up c
 lose and out of their habitats.\nAnimal Hour takes place on most Fridays\,
  while Dive Deeper happens on the last Friday of each month at WonderLab
 ’s stunning coral reef aquarium.
LOCATION:WonderLab\, 308 West 4th Street\, Bloomington
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/animal-hour-and-dive-deeper-2/
