CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Thom Robertson will run two multiplayer sessions of his game A
 rtemis. The bridge-simulator game has persistently been praised at conven
 tions since its release about 10 years ago. The two game sessions kick off
  at 4 p.m.\, with pizza and a Q&A expected to start 6 p.m.
LOCATION:Franklin Hall Commons\, Indiana University\, 601 E Kirkwood Ave\,
  Bloomington
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/artemis-play-session-and-qa-with-thom-robertson
 /
