 EN'>\n<HTML>\n<HEAD>\n<TITLE></TITLE>\n</HEAD>\n<BODY><p>Thom Robertson wi
 ll run two multiplayer sessions of his game Artemis. The bridge-simulator
  game has persistently been praised at conventions since its release about
  10 years ago. The two game sessions kick off at 4 p.m.\, with pizza and a
  Q&A expected to start 6 p.m.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-COST-TYPE:free
END:VEVENT
