DESCRIPTION:You'll visit the Lilly's main galleries\, and your expert guid
 e will talk about some of the Lilly's highlights including the Gutenberg B
 ible\, John James Audubon's Birds of America\, and our current exhibitions
  from the Lilly Library collections. Additional hands-on time with rotatin
 g selections from the collections will follow. These selections include me
 dieval manuscripts\, artists books\, and one of the John Ford's Best Direc
 tor Oscars. Non-flash photography is permitted\, seating is available thro
 ughout the tour\, and the building is wheelchair accessible. The tour gene
 rally lasts a little less than one hour and is open to all.
