 , and your expert guide will talk about some of the Lilly's highlights inc
 luding the Gutenberg Bible\, John James Audubon's <em>Birds of America</em
 >\, and our current exhibitions from the Lilly Library collections. Additi
 onal hands-on time with rotating selections from the collections will foll
 ow. These selections include medieval manuscripts\, artists books\, and on
 e of the John Ford's Best Director Oscars. Non-flash photography is permit
 ted\, seating is available throughout the tour\, and the building is wheel
 chair accessible. The tour generally lasts a little less than one hour and
  is open to all.</p>
