BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"BloomingtonOnline Events": "https://www.facebook.com/events/768428839638314/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:btonline_events
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonOnline Events
SUMMARY:Spring Ephemerals Hike
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260425T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260425T110000
DTSTAMP:20260421T020746Z
UID:e768428839638314@facebook.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20260425T090000
SEQUENCE:0
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260306T125958Z
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy the dawning of a new spring as we hike through Leonard S
 prings\, admiring the first flowering ephemerals! Lasting a very short tim
 e\, this group of flowers brings the first nectar to our emerging pollinat
 ors\, and restores the promise of a new season. We will discuss the folklo
 re behind many of the names as we reconnect with the greening forest. Plea
 se wear sturdy shoes comfortable for hiking. Participants must be able to 
 go up and down 100 stairs.\n\nAll Ages\n$5 per person in-city\, $6 per per
 son non-city\nLocation: Leonard Springs\nSaturday\, April 25\n9-11 a.m.\nR
 egistration closes 4/23.\n\nSPECIAL NOTE: Registration for this event is o
 ffered ONLY through Bloomington Parks & Recreation. "Resale" or transfer o
 f registration is NOT accepted through third parties. If you are offered t
 ickets to this event\, it is a SCAM.\n\nhttps://www.facebook.com/events/76
 8428839638314/
LAST-MODIFIED:20260306T130000Z
LOCATION:Leonard Springs Nature Park
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/768428839638314/
END:VEVENT
