CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:Aramay Moss\; 812-336-5382 ext. 102\; events@sycamorelandtrust.org
 \; https://sycamorelandtrust.org/free-trees/
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Arbor Day by planting a native tree! Sycamore Land T
 rust\, a nonprofit conservation organization protecting over 11\,800 acres
  in southern Indiana\, will give away more than 800 free native tree seedl
 ings on Saturday\, April 25\, from 10 a.m. to 2 p.m. at Bloomingfoods East
  (3220 E. 3rd St.) and Bloomingfoods Near West (316 W. 6th St.) in Bloomin
 gton. Available species include elderberry\, eastern redbud\, persimmon\, 
 gray dogwood\, ninebark\, and red oak. This event is sponsored by IU Healt
 h and co-hosted by Bloomingfoods Co-op Market. Tree seedlings were grown b
 y the Indiana Department of Natural Resources. One free tree seedling per 
 person while supplies last. Learn more at sycamorelandtrust.org/free-trees
 .
LOCATION:Bloomingfoods Co-op Markets\, 3220 E. 3rd St. and 316 W. 6th St.
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/sycamore-land-trusts-arbor-day-tree-giveaway/
