 erry\, eastern redbud\, persimmon\, gray dogwood\, ninebark\, and red oak.
 \n\nTree seedlings were grown by the Indiana Department of Natural Resourc
 es.\n\nThis event takes place simultaneously at two Bloomingfoods location
 s:\n- Bloomingfoods East: 3220 E. 3rd St.\n- Bloomingfoods Near West: 316 
