SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Back by popular demand! Come build with us at CardBoard Build 
 Days\, a hands-on\, creativity-packed program where imagination and engine
 ering meet! Designed for children ages 8 and up\, this experience invites 
 young builders to explore the endless possibilities of cardboard as a cons
 truction material. Drop in and build!\nTo spark creativity and demonstrate
  building strategies\, we’ll have themed stations each showcasing a diff
 erent cardboard crafting technique. Kids can try them all—or simply use 
 them as inspiration for their own original ideas. The stations include:\n\
 n\nMarble Runs: We will have one pre-build for inspiration\n\n\nTowers and
  bridges\n\n\nNature Inspired\n\n\nPresented by Weddle Bros\nRecommended A
 ges: Ages 8 and up\nAdmission: wonderlab.org or specific for the day of th
 e event at: https://bit.ly/cbbd
LOCATION:WonderLab\, 308 West 4th Street\, Bloomington
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/cardboard-build-days-2/
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//
 EN'>\n<HTML>\n<HEAD>\n<TITLE></TITLE>\n</HEAD>\n<BODY><p dir='ltr'>Back by
  popular demand! Come build with us at CardBoard Build Days\, a hands-on\,
  creativity-packed program where imagination and engineering meet! Designe
 d for children ages 8 and up\, this experience invites young builders to e
 xplore the endless possibilities of cardboard as a construction material. 
 Drop in and build!</p>\n<p dir='ltr'>To spark creativity and demonstrate b
 uilding strategies\, we’ll have themed stations each showcasing a differ
 ent cardboard crafting technique. Kids can try them all—or simply use th
 em as inspiration for their own original ideas. The stations include:</p>\
 n<ul>\n<li dir='ltr'>\n<p dir='ltr' role='presentation'>Marble Runs: We wi
 ll have one pre-build for inspiration</p>\n</li>\n<li dir='ltr'>\n<p dir='
 ltr' role='presentation'>Towers and bridges</p>\n</li>\n<li dir='ltr'>\n<p
  dir='ltr' role='presentation'>Nature Inspired</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir='
 ltr'>Presented by Weddle Bros</p>\n<p dir='ltr'>Recommended Ages: Ages 8 a
 nd up</p>\n<p dir='ltr'>Admission: <a href='http://wonderlab.org' target='
 _blank' rel='noopener' data-saferedirecturl='https://www.google.com/url?q=
 http://wonderlab.org&source=gmail&ust=1775586084733000&usg=AOvVaw0aprdewoF
 LWb7-M0zXROe2'>wonderlab.org</a> or specific for the day of the event at: 
 <a href='https://bit.ly/cbbd' target='_blank' rel='noopener' data-saferedi
 recturl='https://www.google.com/url?q=https://bit.ly/cbbd&source=gmail&ust
 =1775586084733000&usg=AOvVaw08l0pJMwa49OGYxILPsmV6'>https://bit.ly/cbbd</a
 ></p>\n<div class='yj6qo'></div>\n</BODY></HTML>
