SUMMARY:QMC Spring Concert: By the Numbers! (Sunday)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260426T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260426T170000
DTSTAMP:20260421T020747Z
UID:5bf5831d-6cb8-4c69-9f29-facf8450447f@bloomington-online
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260426T150000
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260410T180518Z
DESCRIPTION:Quarryland Men's Chorus (QMC) Spring Concert — "By the Numbe
 rs!"\n\nIt's the final countdown! The 24th season of QMC comes to a close 
 with a spring concert celebrating 525\,600 minutes of music history. Featu
 ring numerical songs and a curated musical experience with reasons to laug
 h\, cry\, and cheer.\n\nQMC sings for a measure of belonging\, personal ex
 pression\, and musical excellence in the LGBTQ+ community.\n\nTickets: $20
  general admission | $10 students | 17 and under FREE\nAvailable at https:
 //quarryland.org\, from members\, and at the door.\n\nConcert Sponsor: IU 
 Credit Union\nSeason Sponsors: Shadday Realty Group/Sheetz Century 21 | Ps
 i Iota Xi – Bloomington Thrift Shop\n\nContact: marketing@quarryland.org
  | (812) 345-1065
LAST-MODIFIED:20260410T180518Z
LOCATION:First United Church - Bloomington\, 2420 E 3rd St\, Bloomington\,
  IN 47401
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
