SUMMARY: Showcase of the Arts
DESCRIPTION:The Indiana Chapter of the National Society of Arts and Lette
 rs will present the 60th Annual Showcase of the Arts on Sunday\, April 26
 \, 2026\, at 2 p.m. in the Wells-Metz Theatre in the theatre building at 
 275 N. Eagleson Ave.\, on the IU Campus at Seventh Street.\n\nThe top two
  winners in ballet\, contemporary dance\, drama\, writing\, instrumental 
 music\, voice\, and musical theatre will perform\, and some $60\,000 in a
 wards will be presented.\n\nThe Showcase is free and open to the public.
