DESCRIPTION:This film explores the transformative power of creative resolv
 e in global health. From the frontlines of Rwanda's HIV fight to the histo
 ric eradication of smallpox\, we go behind the scenes with the activists a
 nd experts who refused to accept the status quo. It's more than a history 
 of medicine\; it's a blueprint for a future where health is a right\, not 
 a privilege\, and international solidarity is our strongest vaccine.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260213T180011Z
LOCATION:Shreve Auditorium
URL:https://events.iu.edu/live/events/2190072-preview-screening-of-creatin
 g-resolve
