 wer of creative resolve in global health. From the frontlines of Rwanda's 
 HIV fight to the historic eradication of smallpox\, we go behind the scene
 s with the activists and experts who refused to accept the status quo. It'
 s more than a history of medicine\; it's a blueprint for a future where he
 alth is a right\, not a privilege\, and international solidarity is our st
 rongest vaccine.</p>
