SUMMARY:Habitat for Humanity Car Smash Fundraiser
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260428T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260428T160000
UID:https://iub.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12382135
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/e9
 f833b9-2bd2-4e3d-b0dd-03b82e1b1fb325591126-4456-4ef1-b2c7-a0ea7e7601b1.png
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by: Habitat for Humanity at Indiana University\n\nNeed 
 to blow off some steam before midterms? Come out and support IU Habitat fo
 r Humanity at our Car Smash Fundraiser! For a small donation\, you&rsquo\;
 ll get the chance to smash a car using provided tools and protective gear.
  All proceeds will go directly toward supporting Habitat for Humanity&rsqu
 o\;s mission of building safe\, affordable housing for families in need. W
 hether you&rsquo\;re swinging for stress relief\, fun with friends\, or a 
 good cause\, this is an event you won&rsquo\;t want to miss. &nbsp\;We can
 &rsquo\;t wait to see you there! 💙🔨
LOCATION:Dunn Meadow 1 (West side and concrete pad)
URL:https://iub.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12382135
