SUMMARY:Built Not Bought: T-Shirt Upcycling Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260428T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260428T200000
UID:https://iub.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12433523
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/3d
 e2e759-3018-4f3a-be44-c9a64cfe2fd3bb0054af-f238-4b1b-a1ee-f33da9620d29.PNG
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by: Fashion Forward at IU\n\nThe goal of the event is t
 o empower students to transform unused clothing into bold\, personalized s
 treetwear while fostering creativity\, sustainability\, and self-expressio
 n. The event is a hands-on design experience where members take an old or 
 unused t-shirt and turn it into a custom\, wearable statement piece. Inspi
 red by streetwear culture and DIY fashion\, this event gives students acce
 ss to stencils\, airbrush tools\, bleach dye techniques\, and fabric marke
 rs to completely reimagine their clothing. Whether members prefer minimal 
 graphics or bold experimental designs\, the event encourages creative free
 dom while promoting sustainable fashion practices. No prior experience is 
 required\; members are encouraged to bring a shirt and create a design tha
 t reflects their identity.
LOCATION:Dunn Meadow 1 (West side and concrete pad)
URL:https://iub.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12433523
X-SOURCE:IU beINvolved Student Orgs
END:VEVENT
