SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Head for downtown Martinsville on Thursdays\, April through Oc
 tober for the weekly Cruise-in on the Square! Vehicles of all kinds are we
 lcome – antiques\, classics\, hot rods\, trucks\, motorcycles\, tractors
 \, etc. The weekly cruise-in will be held on Thursdays from 5 to 9 pm each
  week. Come out for a fun evening in downtown Martinsville as you view the
  participating vehicles and enjoy dinner and shopping on the square. The c
 ruise-in will be located on the east side of the square along Jefferson St
 reet\, from Pike to Jackson Streets.
LOCATION:Morgan County Courthouse Square\, 180 Main Street\, Martinsville
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/martinsville-cruise-in-on-the-square/
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//
 EN'>\n<HTML>\n<HEAD>\n<TITLE></TITLE>\n</HEAD>\n<BODY><p>Head for downtown
  Martinsville on Thursdays\, April through October for the weekly Cruise-i
 n on the Square! Vehicles of all kinds are welcome – antiques\, classics
 \, hot rods\, trucks\, motorcycles\, tractors\, etc. The weekly cruise-in 
 will be held on Thursdays from 5 to 9 pm each week. Come out for a fun eve
 ning in downtown Martinsville as you view the participating vehicles and e
 njoy dinner and shopping on the square. The cruise-in will be located on t
 he east side of the square along Jefferson Street\, from Pike to Jackson S
 treets. </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-COST-TYPE:free
END:VEVENT
