BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Bloomington Bicycle Club": "https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=141883"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_cuc66guoam1hhcqq2rnaniinl8_40group_calend
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
URL:https://secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=141883
SUMMARY:I Ride
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260430T174500
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260430T194500
DTSTAMP:20260421T020759Z
UID:s78t1ji96amlnadu8ha9dpfkcg@google.com__20260430
SEQUENCE:1
CREATED:20260316T194515Z
DESCRIPTION:The iRide is a no drop ride with regroup points geared toward 
 the rider wanting to push the pace a bit without being race oriented. 16-1
 8mph avg on most rides. We typically follow the OWLS group route and add s
 ome extra miles/climbs in the second half of the route allowing folks to s
 tart out with us and if we are too fast they can drop back to the OWLS gro
 up. All interested in a brisker pace are welcome!\n\nNon-members should si
 gn up for a free trial membership of up to one month and sign a liability 
 waiver before participating in a club ride. https://secure.getmeregistered
 .com/get_information.php?event_id=141883
LAST-MODIFIED:20260414T101851Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\,
  IN 47401\, USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_cuc66guoam1hhcqq2rnaniinl8_40group_calend
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
SUMMARY:OWLS -
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260430T174500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260430T204500
DTSTAMP:20260421T020759Z
UID:3huef73a3q2gvjkknqsmn1n5rq@google.com__20260430
SEQUENCE:1
CREATED:20260302T170708Z
DESCRIPTION:Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getm
 eregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" target="_blank"><u><u
 ><u>free trial membership</u></u></u></a>\, good for up to one month\, and
  which includes electronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to part
 icipation.<br><br>The “Older\, Wiser\, and a Little Slower” group emph
 asizes moderate rides and a route planned in advance that is posted on the
  ride calendar. This is a no drop ride for a range of intermediate riders
 —it is not a beginner’s ride. Average pace is 12-15 mph which includes
  hills.  Regroup points are discussed in advance. Early season rides are 
 shorter\, and rides get longer as the season progresses. Peak season rides
  average 25–35 miles\, depending on available daylight. Rides depart pro
 mptly at 5:45. Front and rear lights are encouraged. <br><br>Questions? C
 ontact <a href="mailto:gail.morell@gmail.com" target="_blank"><u><u>Gail 
 Morell</u></u></a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260418T161341Z
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Christian Church\, 2700 E Rogers Rd\, Bloomington\,
  IN 47401\, USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
