X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Brown County Playhouse": "https://browncountyplayhouse.org/event/stairway-to-zeppelin-2026/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:brown_county_playhouse
X-SOURCE:Brown County Playhouse
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260501T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260501T213000
DTSTAMP:20260420T203254
CREATED:20260218T191008Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260331T212826Z
UID:10001409-1777663800-1777671000@browncountyplayhouse.org
SUMMARY:Stairway to Zeppelin
DESCRIPTION:Stairway To Zeppelin is becoming the #1 Led Zeppelin Tribute Band in the world delivering Led Zeppelin’s to-the-note studio and live recordings by four incredible musicians. \nStairway To Zeppelin performs a show with visual effects and the latest in sound technology at low decibels with an unparalleled attention to a mix of the original recordings and live performances of the iconic Led Zeppelin. \nThe charisma and musicianship in STZ is world-class bringing the goose-bump-excitement to the audience musically and visually. \nSTZ’s Nashville based members resumes include Heart\, REO Speedwagon\, Wilco\, The Black Crowes\, Fee Waybill/The Tubes\, Richard Marx\, Garth Brooks\, Jewel\, Kenny Chesney\, Rascal Flats\, Autograph\, Quiet Riot… \nTV/Film credits; David Grohl’s film ‘Sound City’\, Pepsi Co/Gatorade\, The Brothers Osborne… \nPrepare to be transported to a time when rock ruled the world!  You will surely agree that Stairway To Zeppelin is the #1 Led Zeppelin Tribute you’ve ever seen performed by four amazing musicians. \nBUY TICKETS\n \n\n \nBUY TICKETS
URL:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/event/stairway-to-zeppelin-2026/
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S. Van Buren St\, Nashville\, IN\, 47448\, United States
CATEGORIES:Clasic Rock,Featured Event,Live Shows,Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/2026-STZ-web_event.jpg
END:VEVENT
