 EN'>\n<HTML>\n<HEAD>\n<TITLE></TITLE>\n</HEAD>\n<BODY><p><strong>Sycamore 
 Land Trust</strong>\, a nonprofit conservation organization protecting ove
 r 11\,800 acres in southern Indiana\, is thrilled to announce their fifth 
 annual Spring Plant Sale! They are offering over 45 species of plants that
  were homegrown in their Native Plant Nursery from seed to plant plug. Man
 y species are grown from locally collected seed at nearby preserves. All s
 pecies are ethically sourced and native to southern Indiana\, providing be
 nefits to local pollinators and wildlife. All proceeds going back into nur
 sery operations and native plant restoration projects. Stop by to learn fr
 om experienced staff and volunteers on the advantages of gardening with na
 tive species!</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-COST-TYPE:free
END:VEVENT
