 cessibility\, and museum guidelines</span></a><span data-contrast="none">.
 </span></li></ul><h3><strong>About Your Facilitator</strong></h3><p>  Deda
 imia Whitney earned an MFA in fiction from Indiana University under the di
 rection of Scott Russell Sanders. She taught creative writing at Franklin 
 College for many years. She has served the museum as a docent since 2019. 
 Her favorite works of art are those that are both visually stimulating and
  thought-provoking.</p>
