SEQUENCE:74666
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260306T125958Z
DESCRIPTION:You are invited to come out to our land and celebrate with us.
  This year marks 50 years of our community in existence. \nWe are sending 
 out a "save the date" Evite soon\,  and are looking for some of our "old t
 imer original folks."\nCamping if you want. Spots will be delegated.\nSatu
 rday evening~ potluck dinner around 6pm \, live music\, bonfire\, and ripp
 ing fabric for our May Pole.\n\nSunday morning begins with a 9:00 am short
  meditation and yoga. Potluck breakfast and we will have some hot dishes. 
 A puppet show\, parade\, hikes\, and coronation of the 2026 May day King &
  Queen. We will have archives and a memorial table\, games\, and much joy 
 to share with you. This is a by-invite event\, but we hope to reach all ou
 r family of friends \n\n\nhttps://www.facebook.com/events/2508624895438814
 8/
LAST-MODIFIED:20260306T130000Z
LOCATION:8755 S Rockport Rd\, Bloomington\, IN 47403-9163\, United States
