DESCRIPTION:Headliner Lloyd Wood leads a star-studded lineup that includ
 es the mind-bending illusions of The Amazing Dennis\, laughs from comedia
 ns Brian Smiley and Cole Peterson\, and a dazzling performance from So
 ngwriter Showdown 2025 winner Sami Riggs. The talented cast of Moon Ove
 r Buffalo takes the stage alongside the hilarious ventriloquist duo Jeff
  Goltz and Tony Bronchitis. Keeping the night rolling is your emcee Hondo
 \, with Mary Ann Soll rounding out the fun as Card Girl.
LOCATION:Historic Brown County Playhouse\, 70 South Van Buren Street\, Nas
 hville
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/variety-show/
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//
 EN'>\n<HTML>\n<HEAD>\n<TITLE></TITLE>\n</HEAD>\n<BODY><p>Headliner Lloyd 
 Wood leads a star-studded lineup that includes the mind-bending illusions
  of The Amazing Dennis\, laughs from comedians Brian Smiley and Cole P
 eterson\, and a dazzling performance from Songwriter Showdown 2025 winne
 r Sami Riggs. The talented cast of <em>Moon Over Buffalo</em> takes the
  stage alongside the hilarious ventriloquist duo Jeff Goltz and Tony Bron
 chitis. Keeping the night rolling is your emcee Hondo\, with Mary Ann So
 ll rounding out the fun as Card Girl.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
