 re for the week by making art or journaling\, and make some time to check 
 in with yourself!</p><p>  The art studio will be open and equipped with ar
 t activities meant to help you feel more balanced and in control\, while t
 he nearby Martin Commons will have some yoga mats available for light stre
 tching (when space allows).</p><p>  This group meets every Monday from 2-3
  p.m.\, excluding holidays and museum closures. The group will meet in the
  Roehm Family Art-making Studio\, located inside the Simpson Center for Ed
 ucation on the 2nd floor of the Eskenazi Museum of Art.</p>
