 the rider wanting to push the pace a bit without being race oriented. 16-1
 8mph avg on most rides. We typically follow the OWLS group route and add s
 ome extra miles/climbs in the second half of the route allowing folks to s
 tart out with us and if we are too fast they can drop back to the OWLS gro
 up. All interested in a brisker pace are welcome!\n\nNon-members should si
 gn up for a free trial membership of up to one month and sign a liability 
 waiver before participating in a club ride. https://secure.getmeregistered
 .com/get_information.php?event_id=141883
