SUMMARY:Mindful Mondays
DTSTART:20260511T180000Z
DTEND:20260511T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20260109T125019Z
UID:20260427T180000Z-2165244@events.iu.edu__20260511
ATTACH:https://events.iu.edu/live/image/gid/234/width/168/height/168/crop/
 1/src_region/0,0,1600,1590/26244_xx2006.2_o3_2.rev.1743185388.jpg
CATEGORIES:Health and wellness
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the museum and mentally prepare for the week by mak
 ing art or journaling\, and make some time to check in with yourself!  The
  art studio will be open and equipped with art activities meant to help yo
 u feel more balanced and in control\, while the nearby Martin Commons will
  have some yoga mats available for light stretching (when space allows).  
 This group meets every Monday from 2-3 p.m.\, excluding holidays and museu
 m closures. The group will meet in the Roehm Family Art-making Studio\, lo
 cated inside the Simpson Center for Education on the 2nd floor of the Eske
 nazi Museum of Art.
GEO:39.169144;-86.519739
LAST-MODIFIED:20260109T175019Z
LOCATION:SIDNEY AND LOIS ESKENAZI MUSEUM OF ART - Room Number: Roehm Famil
 y Art-making Studio
URL:https://events.iu.edu/live/events/2154780-mindful-mondays
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Join us at the museum and mentally prepa
 re for the week by making art or journaling\, and make some time to check 
 in with yourself!</p><p>  The art studio will be open and equipped with ar
 t activities meant to help you feel more balanced and in control\, while t
 he nearby Martin Commons will have some yoga mats available for light stre
 tching (when space allows).</p><p>  This group meets every Monday from 2-3
  p.m.\, excluding holidays and museum closures. The group will meet in the
  Roehm Family Art-making Studio\, located inside the Simpson Center for Ed
