 btrac.bloomington.in.gov/webtrac/web/search.html?Primarycode=265201">https
 ://webtrac.bloomington.in.gov/webtrac/web/search.html?Primarycode=265201</
 a><br>Join us for an evening in the garden learning the proper techniques 
 for propagating our culinary herb garden\, before sharing the bounty. Each
  participant will come away with the knowledge of how to make cuttings fro
 m mature plants\, where to best plant the cuttings\, and how to use their 
 unique flavor profiles. All participants will take home their own miniatur
 e herb garden to start the season. Come with questions and leave with herb
 s. Children under 12 yrs. must be accompanied by an adult.
