DESCRIPTION:The Ms. Lake Lemon Pageant — a community fundraiser for the 
 Monroe Fire Protection District.\n\nContestants compete in gown while perf
 orming real-world tasks like moving hazards\, backing up a trailer\, hamme
 ring nails\, and casting a fishing line. Bonus prizes for best embellished
  work gloves\, most powerful livestock/pet call\, trivia\, and best cheerl
 eader.\n\nContestants must be 37+ and have grit. Entry fee: $15–$45\, pa
 y what you can.\n\nWinner receives a $100 bill\, tiara\, and the Lady Tres
 tle sash.
