SUMMARY:Finn: A New Musical–a sensory-friendly performance–At the PB&J
  Cafe
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260517T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260517T160000
DTSTAMP:20260421T020832Z
UID:ai1ec-140529@wfhb.org
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20260517T160000
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:From the creator of Doc McStuffins and Vampirina\, Finn is a h
 eartwarming musical adventure about a young shark on the brink of growing 
 up. As he prepares to join the fearsome Shark Guard\, Finn can’t shake t
 he feeling that he’s different from the other sharks. Deep inside\, he d
 iscovers a colorful fish inside him—a part of himself that longs to spar
 kle\, sing\, and dance. As Finn embarks on a journey of self-discovery\, f
 riendship\, and adventure\, he finds the courage to be himself! Fun for al
 l ages!\nPB&J Cafe: A Dinner Theater for Kids! At the PB&J Cafe\, young th
 eatergoers will enjoy a meal during the performance and leave with autogra
 phs from their favorite characters.
LOCATION:Waldron Arts Center. 122 S. Walnut Street\, Bloomington
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/finn-a-new-musical-a-sensory-friendly-performan
 ce-at-the-pbj-cafe/
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//
 EN'>\n<HTML>\n<HEAD>\n<TITLE></TITLE>\n</HEAD>\n<BODY><p dir='ltr'>From th
 e creator of Doc McStuffins and Vampirina\, Finn is a heartwarming musical
  adventure about a young shark on the brink of growing up. As he prepares 
 to join the fearsome Shark Guard\, Finn can’t shake the feeling that he
 ’s different from the other sharks. Deep inside\, he discovers a colorfu
 l fish inside him—a part of himself that longs to sparkle\, sing\, and d
 ance. As Finn embarks on a journey of self-discovery\, friendship\, and ad
 venture\, he finds the courage to be himself! Fun for all ages!</p>\n<p di
 r='ltr'>PB&J Cafe: A Dinner Theater for Kids! At the PB&J Cafe\, young the
 atergoers will enjoy a meal during the performance and leave with autograp
 hs from their favorite characters.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
