 t tech course\, offering tracks in five different areas: Digital Marketing
 \, Data Analytics\, Web Development for Everyone\, Coding for Data\, and C
 areer Rotation. Registration is open for both the Summer 2026 and Fall 202
 6 semesters. The deadline to apply for the Summer 2026 semester is Monday\
 , May 18\, which is also the first day of classes. Apply for the Fall 2026
  semester by August 24\, 2026.
