 ission</b></h3><ul><li>Daily admission $7/person. Ages 4 yrs. and younger 
 admitted at no charge.</li><li>Bryan Park Pool Morning Lap Swim (M\, F\, a
 nd Sa from 10-11 a.m.) admission $5/person. Lap swimmers must pay regular 
