DESCRIPTION:<p>Kick off the summer season in Bryan Park!</p><h2><b>Summer 
 Launch Party</b></h2><ul><li><strong><b>Admission:</b></strong> Free</li>
 <li><strong><b>Day: </b></strong>Saturday\, May 23</li><li><strong><b>Tim
 e: </b></strong>5:30-8:30 p.m. The first hour\, from 10-11 a.m.\, is sens
 ory friendly with no flashing lights or loud noises.</li><li><address><p>B
 ryan Park<br>1001 S. Henderson St.<br>Bloomington\, IN 47401</p></address>
 </li></ul><p>This family-friendly celebration shines a spotlight on the ex
 citing lineup of events and programs happening throughout Bloomington this
  summer. The community comes together for an evening of live music\, hands
 -on children's activities\, interactive games\,and opportunities to learn 
 about upcoming events and programs for all ages.</p>
