 , a sketchbook or drawing paper\, and a phone or device to photograph artw
 ork (without flash) as we sketch.  </li></ul><h3><strong>Know Before You G
 o</strong></h3><ul><li>Arrive early to find parking\, check in\, and get y
 our drawing supplies ready.  </li><li>At 1:55 p.m. any unclaimed reservati
 ons will be released to guests who are standing by waiting for a spot.  </
 li><li><a href="https://artmuseum.indiana.edu/visit/your-visit.html">Where
  to find us\, where to park\, accessibility\, and museum guidelines</a>.  
 </li><li>This workshop is recommended for ages 12 and up. Anyone under 18\
 , who is not an IU student\, must be accompanied by an adult.  </li></ul><
