DESCRIPTION:Join us at the museum and mentally prepare for the week by mak
 ing art or journaling\, and make some time to check in with yourself!  The
  art studio will be open and equipped with art activities meant to help yo
 u feel more balanced and in control\, while the nearby Martin Commons will
  have some yoga mats available for light stretching (when space allows).  
 This group meets every Monday from 2-3 p.m.\, excluding holidays and museu
 m closures. The group will meet in the Roehm Family Art-making Studio\, lo
 cated inside the Simpson Center for Education on the 2nd floor of the Eske
 nazi Museum of Art.
