DESCRIPTION:<p>🎤 <strong>Join us every 2nd &amp\; 4th Wednesday from 7
 –9 PM at Bloomington Farm Stop for Open Mic Night!</strong> Whether you'
 re a musician\, poet\, storyteller\, or just a fan of local talent\, this 
 cozy community event is the perfect midweek reset. Perform or simply enjoy
  the show — all are welcome.</p><p>Enjoy sweet and savory snacks\, beer\
 , and non-alcoholic drinks while you listen in a relaxed café setting. No
  cover\, no pressure — just good vibes\, great company\, and a rotating 
 lineup of local voices. </p>
