BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Eskenazi Museum of Art": "https://events.iu.edu/artmuseum/event/2154849-palette-pals", "IU First Nations Center": "https://events.iu.edu/live/events/2154849-palette-pals", "IU La Casa Latino Cultural Center": "https://events.iu.edu/live/events/2154849-palette-pals"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Eskenazi Museum of Art": "https://events.iu.edu/artmuseum/event/2154849-palette-pals"}
X-SOURCE-ID:iu_eskenazi_museum
X-SOURCE:Eskenazi Museum of Art, IU First Nations Center, IU La Casa Latino Cultural Center
SUMMARY:Palette Pals
DTSTART:20260528T180000Z
DTEND:20260528T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20251219T135524Z
UID:20260521T180000Z-2154849@events.iu.edu__20260528
ATTACH:https://events.iu.edu/live/image/gid/234/width/168/height/168/crop/
 1/src_region/0,0,3200,2134/2693_2I1A0095_1.rev.1573483976.jpg
CATEGORIES:Art and museum exhibitions,Culture and languages,Health and wel
 lness
DESCRIPTION:It's never a bad time to make new friends! Come make art and m
 eet others with common interests during our monthly friend-finding art gro
 up\, Palette Pals!  Sessions will include art prompts meant to help build 
 connection with others\, but if you just want to flex your creative muscle
 s and make what you like\, feel free to bring your own art supplies and cr
 eate something while in the company of others!  This group meets on the 3r
 d Thursday of every month\, excluding holidays and museum closures. It is 
 open to everyone: students\, staff\, and the public included! The group wi
 ll meet in the Roehm Family Art-making Studio\, located inside the Simpson
  Center for Education on the 2nd floor of the Eskenazi Museum of Art.
GEO:39.169144;-86.519739
LAST-MODIFIED:20251219T193127Z
