 bloom
DESCRIPTION:Garage Con is back again after 7 years!\nPlay board games\, ca
 rd games\, RPGs\, and more all day. There will be game demos\, scheduled g
 ames\, or you can choose from the huge games library. Attendees are encour
 aged to bring their own games to share as well. There will be plenty of sp
 ace\, snacks & drinks for sale\, raffle prizes\, and\, of course\, tons of
  games to play all day… Come for a quickie or stay for some epic all-day
  gaming.\nHow does Garage Con work?\nWe love tabletop gaming\, so we’re 
 bringing our board game collection and sharing with the community. Sign ou
 t a game to play with your friends or someone new. We’ll talk you throug
 h the rules if you want to try a game you’ve never played before.
LOCATION:Bloomington Convention Center: 302 S College Ave
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/garage-con-iv/
