 ttps://switchyardpark.com/recreation/spray-pad/"><u>Community Foundation S
 witchyard Plaza Spray Pad at Switchyard Park</u></a></p></h3><h3><b>Hours 
 of Operation</b></h3><ul><li>Bryan Park Pool is open May 23-Aug. 3\, 2026.
 </li><li>Operating hours are 11 a.m.-7 p.m. daily.</li><li>Pool is closed 
 Tuesday\, Aug. 4 through Friday\, Aug. 7.</li><li>Open Saturday and Sunday
  only beginning Saturday\, Aug. 8 and ending Monday\, Sept. 7 (Labor Day).
  Pool is open Sept. 7.</li></ul><p>Operating hours are subject to change. 
 The pool\, or portions of the pool\, may close due to lifeguard shortages\
 , low attendance\, or threatening weather. For updates on hours of operati
 on or the open status of Bryan Park Pool and Mills Pool\, <a><u>call the 
 Splash &amp\; Skate Hotline</u></a> (812-349-3741).</p><h3><b>General Adm
 ission</b></h3><ul><li>Daily admission $7/person. Ages 4 yrs. and younger 
 admitted at no charge.</li><li>Bryan Park Pool Morning Lap Swim (M\, F\, a
 nd Sa from 10-11 a.m.) admission $5/person. Lap swimmers must pay regular 
 admission price when pool opens at 11 a.m.</li></ul>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260327T144524Z
