BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Limestone Post": "https://indyrunners.org/view-race-details/momofo-100k-20-mile-fun-run-virtual-options/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:limestone_post
SUMMARY:MoMoFo 100k & 20 mile fun run & virtual options
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260605T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260605T190000
UID:260105dYMxWMAPo0OGQhWofJ-Vng
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://citysparkstorage.blob.core.windows.net/p
 ortalimages/portalimages/87f99038-5721-47ad-94ff-8ba8cc3b53e9.large.png
DESCRIPTION:This 100km trail race will prove that there’s more than just
  corn in Indiana! Situated in Indiana’s beautiful Morgan Monroe State Fo
 rest\, this evening-start event will have plenty to offer throughout the n
 ight with its old growth forests\, natural rock formations\, lakes\, and c
 reeks. Oh\, and did we mention the hills? With about 8\,500 feet of climbi
 ng—yes\, over 8.5k of climbing!—in addition to southern Indiana’s ty
 pical summertime heat and humidity\, this race is tougher than you’d thi
 nk. Comprised of 85% single track\, 11% forest service road\, and 4% paved
  road \\(but with a generous cutoff time of 20 hours\\)\, we assure you th
 at you won’t be disappointed. \n\nFor those less adventurous trail nuts 
 we offer up our “fun run”.  If you aren’t quite up for the full 100
 km we have a 20 mile loop for you to “enjoy”.  This run will start Sa
 turday June  6 at 8:30am. You will have a SUPER generous 6 hours and 30 m
 inutes to complete one loop. This is the  same loop as the 100k folks wit
 h the same unbelievable support at each aid station. \n\nWe invite you to 
 experience true Hoosier hospitality with our fun and friendly trail runnin
 g community.\n\nCome help make this a trail party…WooHoo! \n\n 
LOCATION:Morgan Monroe State Forest
URL:https://indyrunners.org/view-race-details/momofo-100k-20-mile-fun-run-
 virtual-options/
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Brown County Playhouse": "https://browncountyplayhouse.org/event/moon-over-buffalo-live-theatre/2026-06-05/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:brown_county_playhouse
X-SOURCE:Brown County Playhouse
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260605T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260605T213000
DTSTAMP:20260420T203254
CREATED:20260402T145229Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260403T125211Z
UID:10001437-1780687800-1780695000@browncountyplayhouse.org
SUMMARY:Moon Over Buffalo [Live Theatre]
DESCRIPTION:Moon Over Buffalo \nby Ken Ludwig \nIt is the summer of 1953\, and George and Charlotte Hay\, former Broadway stars\, have taken their run-down touring company to Buffalo\, New York. In Buffalo they have the intention of running “Cyrano de Bergerac” and “Private Lives” in repertory\, all the while grumbling about missed Hollywood opportunities. But on-stage harmony is compromised when George performs an off-stage infidelity\, impregnating the company’s ingenue. When Charlotte learns of this\, she prepares to run away with the family lawyer\, sending lightweight George on a grief-stricken drinking binge. Meanwhile\, it  turns out that Frank Capra is headed to town on a talent scouting mission looking to hire the couple for his swashbuckling Scarlet Pimpernel epic. As a result\, the Hay family — including scornful\, deaf mother-in-law Ethel\, determinedly practical daughter Rosalind\, and dashing actor Paul\, Rosalind’s ex-boyfriend — must work overtime to get sloppy drunk George into his Cyrano hat and nose…. or is it his Elyot Chase smoking jacket? With the entrance of Rosalind’s fiancé\, anxious TV weatherman Howard — one man with two mistaken identities — and Richard Maynard\, the wealthy lawyer hoping to lure Charlotte away to his mansion — the confusion only intensifies. \n  \nCAST & CREW\nGeorge: Ed Phillips\nPaul: Brenden King\nHoward: Larry Compton\nRichard: Tim Staggs\nCharlotte: Kristy Kelly\nRosalind: Dania Leova\nEileen: Erin Rudich\nEthel: Sheila Popplewell \nDirector: Steve Booker\nAssistant Director: Wendi Gore \n  \nTickets - Fri\, May 29\, 7:30 PM\n\nTickets - Sat\, May 30\, 7:30 PM\n\nTickets - Sun\, May 31\, 2:30 PM\n\nTickets - Fri\, June 5\, 7:30 PM\n\nTickets - Sat\, June 6\, 7:30 PM
URL:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/event/moon-over-buffalo-live-theatre/2026-06-05/
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S. Van Buren St\, Nashville\, IN\, 47448\, United States
CATEGORIES:Featured Event,Live Shows,Play,Theatre
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2026-MoonOverBuffalo_web_event.jpg
END:VEVENT
