SUMMARY:Hike of the Tecumseh Trail extension as a
DESCRIPTION:Knobstone Hiking Trail Association of Indiana Meetup\nCome hike the just built section of the Tecumseh Trail extension. The Trail is linear but we can use forest roads to make it a loop. The gate at Hatfield Ridge Road should be open so we’ll meet at the parking lot at the end of the road. If people want\, we can go to lunch at Indy’s nearby when we get done. This is a beautiful section of trail so be sure to come.
