DESCRIPTION:Earn honorary Zookeeper status by creating animal crafts with 
 us!\n\nCalling all animal lovers!  Learn about different exotic animals t
 hrough crafts\, games and other fun activities. Earn your honorary Zookeep
 er status when you attend multiple events in the series! \n\nParticipation
  fee $3 per person each event. Pre-registration not required. Meet at the 
 Bosque in Switchyard Park\, located east of the Switchyard Park Pavilion.\
 n\nCommunity Zoo by You is held the second Tuesday of the month\, April th
 rough October.\n\nThis event is for families with young children and schoo
 l-aged children. The cost is $3/participant\, admission is paid only at th
 e event. If someone offers you a ticket\, it is a scam!
LAST-MODIFIED:20250926T215020Z
