CREATED:20260122T184612Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>🎤 <strong>Join us every 2nd &amp\; 4th Wednesday from 7
 –9 PM at Bloomington Farm Stop for Open Mic Night!</strong> Whether you
 're a musician\, poet\, storyteller\, or just a fan of local talent\, this
  cozy community event is the perfect midweek reset. Perform or simply enjo
 y the show — all are welcome.</p><p>Enjoy sweet and savory snacks\, beer
 \, and non-alcoholic drinks while you listen in a relaxed café setting. N
 o cover\, no pressure — just good vibes\, great company\, and a rotating
  lineup of local voices. </p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260122T184803Z
LOCATION:902 W Kirkwood Ave\, Bloomington\, IN
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
