SUMMARY:Toddler Sports Classes
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260613T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260613T120000
UID:260324sFcXJIF5uEqUJDi8-yKdPg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://citysparkstorage.blob.core.windows.net/p
 ortalimages/portalimages/wWprhzPqOE6BC9X6I0f2DA.large.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Playpen Sports Academy is a wonderful way to introduce your ch
 ild to the world of sport and physical activity in a non-intimidating envi
 ronment with a small group of other toddlers and parents. The Playpen Spor
 ts Academy Curriculum is focused on a number of different goals including 
 teaching children how to move and use their bodies\, sharing with other ch
 ildren\, interact in social settings\, follow directions\, and most import
 antly how to have fun in a physically active environment. At Playpen Sport
 s Academy\, we are focused as much on the individual development of your c
 hild as we are on sport specific skills that we teach. Because while we ex
 pect some of your children to go on to be great athletes\, we expect all o
 f your children to go on to be great people!
URL:https://www.playpensports.com/
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Knobstone Hiking Trail Association Of Indiana Meetup": "https://www.meetup.com/knobstone-hiking-trail-association-of-indiana-meetup/events/312918122/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_knobstone_hiking_trail_association_of_indiana_meetup
X-SOURCE:Meetup Knobstone Hiking Trail Association Of Indiana Meetup
UID:event_312918122@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260421T020749Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260613T091500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260613T151500
SUMMARY:2nd Weekend Work Day Trail Building
DESCRIPTION:Knobstone Hiking Trail Association of Indiana Meetup\nWould you to spend a day in some beautiful woods with a delightful group of people building a connecting section of Indiana’s premier long distance hiking trail? Come join us as we continue work on the Tecumseh Trail extension portion of the KHT in MMSF. We will be building the new trail including clipping green briar.\nPlease bring a lunch and water. We will have large hand tools\, but please bring any small tools you have such as clippers or a pruning saw. And a backpack is handy to carry everything in. Instructions will be provided for those who need them. We finish about 3:30.\nMeet at the Hatfield Ridge Road gate. The gate is locked but we have a key. Go to the big sign on Rosenbaum/Catholic Cemetry Rd.\nJoin us on our website at http://www.knobstonehikingtrail.org/\, on Facebook at [www.facebook.com/groups/2255586117953484](http://www.facebook.com/groups/2255586117953484)\, and Substack [https://khta.substack.com/](https://khta.substack.com/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/knobstone-hiking-trail-association-of-indiana-meetup/events/312918122/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260116T195308Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260116T195308Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/2/1/1/600_451380529.jpeg
END:VEVENT
