DESCRIPTION:Cool down your body while heating up your mind as we discuss w
 hat we see as a group\, helping each other discover details we might other
 wise miss in a quick visit through the galleries.    About Your Guide  Dr.
  TammyJo Eckhart is an ancient historian who has enjoyed being part of the
  Eskenazi Guide Program since 2009. She was the 2025 recipient of the Patr
 icia and Joel Meier Guide Award from that program. She looks forward to si
 tting with you and really spending time with these wonderful landscapes.  
   Know Before You Go  Space is available for the first 12 people to check 
 in with Guest Services on the day. Drop by the information desk on the fir
 st floor of the museum when you arrive.A small handbag may be carried at y
 our side. Backpacks and large bags will need to be stored before touring. 
 Learn more aboutmuseum guidelines.If you park in the IMU parking lot\, Gue
 st Services can validate your parking voucher for a discount.Read aboutwhe
 re to find us and where to park\,
