 Recreation hosts a celebration of art and community with the sales\, demo
 nstrations\, and displays of art and fine crafts by local and regional ar
 tists.\n\n\nA Fair of the Arts takes place on the second Saturdays of the
  summer season\, May through October\, in conjunction with the Bloomingto
 n Community Farmers' Market at the following location:\n\nFernandez Plaza
  (in front of City Hall)\n401 N. Morton St.\, Bloomington\, IN
